---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { tok } from '../lib/tokens.mjs';
---

<Legal heading="Privacy Policy">
  <p>
    This Privacy Policy explains how FGFC Markets Global Ltd (“the Company”, “we”, “us”), a
    company incorporated under the laws of Mauritius with registered office at Premier Business Centre, 10th Floor, Sterling Tower, 14 Poudriere Street, Port Louis, Mauritius, collects,
    uses and protects personal data obtained through this website.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Data we collect</h2>
  <p>
    Through this website we collect only the information you choose to submit via the
    contact form: your first name, last name, email address, the subject of your inquiry
    and the content of your message. Standard technical data (such as IP address, browser
    type and pages visited) may be recorded in server logs for security and diagnostic
    purposes.
  </p>

  <h2>2. How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To respond to inquiries submitted through the contact form;</li>
    <li>To meet legal and regulatory obligations that apply to a licensed investment firm;</li>
    <li>To maintain the security and integrity of this website.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell personal data, and we do not use it for automated decision-making.</p>

  <h2>3. Legal basis</h2>
  <p>
    Personal data is processed on the basis of your consent (when you submit the form), the
    Company’s legitimate interest in operating a secure corporate website, and the legal
    obligations applicable to the Company under the regulatory framework of the Financial
    Services Commission (FSC) of Mauritius and applicable Mauritius data-protection law.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Retention</h2>
  <p>
    Correspondence is retained only for as long as needed to handle your inquiry and to
    satisfy record-keeping duties that apply to regulated firms, after which it is deleted
    or anonymised.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Sharing</h2>
  <p>
    Personal data may be disclosed where required by law, to the Company’s supervisory
    authority (the Financial Services Commission of Mauritius), or to service providers who
    process data on our behalf under appropriate confidentiality and data-processing terms.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Subject to applicable law, you may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your
    personal data, object to or restrict its processing, and lodge a complaint with the
    competent data-protection authority in Mauritius. To exercise these rights, contact
    compliance@fgfc-markets.com.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this policy can be addressed to compliance@fgfc-markets.com or in
    writing to Premier Business Centre, 10th Floor, Sterling Tower, 14 Poudriere Street, Port Louis, Mauritius.
  </p>

  <p class="note" set:html={tok('Last updated: [DATE].')} />
</Legal>
